This topic is part of the \\pkg{tspracticals} practical-code reference. Use
\\code{cat(set3(), sep = "\\n")} to print the code for copying, or call
\\code{set3()} to retrieve it as a character string.
}
\\examples{
cat(set3(), sep = "\\n")
}
